{"ref":"BDB, חֹבֶ֫רֶת","hw":"חֹבֶ֫רֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹבֶ֫רֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. a thing that joins</strong> or <strong>is joined</strong>, only of the <em>curtain-pieces</em> of the tabernacle, as <em>joined together:</em>—<span dir=\"rtl\">הַח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:10\" href=\"/Exodus.26.10\">Ex 26:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:17\" href=\"/Exodus.36.17\">36:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּחֹבָ֑רֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:4\" href=\"/Exodus.26.4\">Ex 26:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:10\" href=\"/Exodus.26.10\">10</a>.","next":"BDB, חַבָּר","prev":"BDB, חֲבֶ֫רֶת"}